WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.303
Skip the lifts. Get a plan.

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:07.039
Tap Build, then Build My Workout. Leave the lifts blank.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.426
It picks what you have gone longest without.

00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:15.000
Open How this session was built. It says why each lift is there.

00:00:15.433 --> 00:00:19.659
Pick the lifts yourself. The volume adjusts to your history.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:24.465
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
